@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/[topic_uuid]/actions/set_summary_prompt/invoke
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamTopicController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "背景表演者\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/{topic_uuid}/actions/set_summary_prompt/invoke
API -> DB: 交易开始; 简介配置 TOPIC + transactional outbox
API -> DB: 在此中添加不可更改的记录 transactional outbox
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: topic_state_projection / delivery_snapshot_event\n每一个 task 有自己的 outbox_event_uuid
Worker -> Worker: claim exact scope; 为了 topic work\nMESSAGE.created_at DESC
Worker -> Projection: 题目总结 + 用户的题目介绍
Worker -> Events: topic.updated\n原子在一个 DB transaction 投影
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
@enduml
